SUMMARY:Rippling - Built For Borderless Growth
URL:https://ripplingborderlessgrowth.co.nz
DESCRIPTION:Thank you for registering for our upcoming event - Built For Borderless Growth.\n\nWe’re bringing together a small group of CFOs\, HR and People leaders in Auckland for an open conversation around the realities of growing and managing a workforce across regions. From operational scalability and distributed teams to the systems and processes that can either enable growth or slow it down\, this is designed to be a practical\, peer-led discussion rather than another presentation.\n\nEvent Details: \nDate: Friday\, 25th of September 2026 \nTime: 12:00 - 2:30pm \nLocation: Gilt Brasseri – 2 Chancery Street\, Chambers\, Auckland 1010\, New Zealand\n\nWe look forward to seeing you!
LOCATION:2 Chancery Street\, Chambers\, Auckland 1010\, New Zealand
END:VEVENT
